                                "sense_id": "e30f6d70-5d85-3239-8362-c18cc5b91b01",
                                "text": "The movement has been re-jigged for a North American audience in some places, such as the Pacific Northwest, where the concept of 'Complete Communities” has gained favor in ensuring that neighborhoods are diverse, choiceful, and outfitted with the full panoply of social services, institutions and amenities […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccaae3a0-0fe4-40f7-8661-e6c231080a8f",
                                "sense_id": "e30f6d70-5d85-3239-8362-c18cc5b91b01",
                                "text": "Rather, all the information, tools, and tips are simply aimed at keeping you conscious and choiceful."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
